  "title": {
   "en": "Kirawaremono no Akuyaku Reijou Alisha Libra wa Magerarenai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "嫌われ者の悪役令嬢アリーシャ・リブラはまげられない"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Alisha Libra, the daughter of an aristocrat, dies in an unexpected accident.\nWhen Alisha meets the Goddess, she is told that the world she was in was a game, and that she was a villainess character.\nAlisha escapes from the game world and reincarnates as Arisa Nanao, a high school girl in the real world.\nShe hopes that this time she will not be a villain but a ladylike person who is loved by many people.\nHowever, her strong-willed nature remains unchanged, and her story begins when Arisa speaks out about her classmate's behavior that cannot be overlooked."
  },
